course: dictionary
lesson: 12788
title: The word eighteenth
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Eighteenth tells you the position of something in a line or list. It comes straight after the seventeenth. «She was the eighteenth person in the queue.» Here, eighteenth means number 18 in the line.
explain: Eighteenth is also a fraction word. One eighteenth, written 1/18, is one of eighteen equal parts of something. «Cut the pizza into eighteen equal slices, and each slice is one eighteenth of the pizza.»
explain: Use eighteenth for position, and use an eighteenth for a part. «He ate an eighteenth of the cake.» The word sounds the same, but the clues in the sentence show which meaning is right.
explain: In the UK, Australia and New Zealand, an eighteenth is also a party for someone turning 18. «Her eighteenth was held in the village hall, with music and balloons.»
fact: Eighteenth is an ordinal number: it shows order, and it is written 18th.
fact: «Eighteenth» means coming next after the seventeenth in a line or list.
fact: As a fraction, one eighteenth is written 1/18: one of eighteen equal parts.
fact: A golf course has eighteen holes, so «the eighteenth hole» is one of them.
fact: In the UK, Australia and New Zealand, «an eighteenth» can mean a party for someone turning 18, and «eighteenth birthday» is the birthday when someone turns 18.
exercise: Which number is written as 18th? | 17th | 81st | *18th | 8th
exercise: A pizza is cut into eighteen equal slices. One slice is one what? | eighth | eight | *eighteenth | eighteen
exercise: «Maya was the eighteenth child to arrive at the party.» What place did Maya arrive in? | *Eighteenth | Seventeenth | Eighteen | Eightieth
test: What is one eighteenth written as a fraction? | 18/1 | *1/18 | 1/8 | 1/81
test: «Jack's eighteenth birthday is in May.» What does this mean? | *The birthday when he turns 18 | The birthday when he is 80 | A pair of eighteen socks | Something he finished in May
exam: Which letter is the eighteenth letter of the alphabet? | Q | *R | T | S
